FEATURES OF K8S 

Automated scheduling : efficiently places containers on nodes for optimal resources use 

SEFL HEALING : automatically restarts , replaces and reshedules failed containers 

rollouts and rollbacks : manages application updates and reverts when needed 

scaling and load balacing : supports horizontal scaling and distributes traffic 

resource optimisation : monitors and ensures efficient resource utilization 

